        "logo": "shopify://shop_images/WFG2_-_stacked.png",
        "title": "Coffee That Supports Clean Water",
        "description": "<p>Together with <a href=\"https://waterforgood.org/\">Water for Good</a> and Project Origin, we’re continuing our long-term commitment to support safe, reliable water in coffee-growing communities.</p><p>From <strong>1–31 October</strong>, we’ll make a fixed contribution from every participating purchase toward our <strong>$20,000 fundraising goal</strong>. You don’t need to make a separate donation—simply choose a participating coffee or product and be part of the impact.</p><p>This campaign brings us closer to our longer-term goal of helping support <strong>250 community water points over seven years</strong>, creating lasting, community-led access to clean water.</p>",
        "cta_text": "Learn more",
        "cta_url": "shopify://blogs/news/coffee-community-and-clean-water-continuing-our-work-with-water-for-good"
